        "IconCard",
        "BookCard",
        "TableOfContents",
        "TextCta"
      ],
      "contract": "Topic uses split 2/3 hero, route cards, fact band, latest cards and CTA. Report uses coloured introduction and four-section reading layout with TOC. Index uses three collection groups of three BookCards. English and Arabic authored copy and root lang/dir. Internal breadcrumbs are page markup, not the draft four-item Breadcrumbs contract.",
      "responsive": "Container/grid source controls narrow stacking and tablet columns. Report reading rail switches at 48rem. Fixed narrow/wide scenes must preserve each archetype rather than substitute a common generic hero/card page.",
      "coverage": "Partial child recipe coverage for Hero, VerticalCard, TextCta and TOC. IconCard/BookCard/chrome/page assemblies open. No native page acceptance."
    },
    {
      "id": "article-news-detail",
      "source": "stories/Patterns/ArticleStory/ArticleStory.jsx",
      "classification": "story-only editorial/news-detail composition",
      "presets": [
        "large image",
        "compact image",
        "no hero image",
        "alternate hero image",
        "split hero"
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "UndrrChrome",
        "SkipLink",
        "VerticalCard",
        "Hero",
        "TableOfContents",
        "ShareButtons",
        "UserFeedback",
        "Imagecaption",
        "HighlightBox",
        "QuoteHighlight",
        "EmbedContainer"
      ],
      "contract": "Actual news correspondence is ArticleStory: /news category and related-story links. Header has category, title, summary, date and linked source. Rail contains sharing and TOC. English placement samples include QuoteHighlight, floated rich HighlightBox and 16:9 iframe EmbedContainer. Related cards, recommendations and linked taxonomy complete the page. No distinct NewsPage source was found in stories/Patterns.",
      "responsive": "Reading article max 46rem with 16rem rail at 48rem; compact media follows reading width; split header uses Hero source. Article float/inline rich copy and Arabic font routing need explicit comparison.",
      "coverage": "Draft UserFeedback covers initial only; plain draft HighlightBox excludes article rich floated sample; Tag draft does not cover taxonomy anchor container. Core bounded TOC and local Hero/cards do not accept arbitrary page content."
    },
    {
      "id": "content-hub",
      "source": "stories/Patterns/ContentHub/ContentHub.jsx",
      "classification": "story-only route-driven composition",
      "presets": [
        "landing",
