        "UndrrChrome",
        "SkipLink",
        "HubHeader",
        "Hero",
        "VerticalCard",
        "IconCard",
        "TextCta",
        "TableOfContents"
      ],
      "contract": "Hash routes are authored states, not nine new component families. Five section links, parent reporting selection for detail routes, conditional breadcrumb, header-owned or page-owned hero, optional TOC, icon/vertical route cards and authored detail copy. Surface primary/secondary/tertiary/detached and media image/video controls require source-specific fixtures.",
      "responsive": "HubHeader changes at 48rem: mobile gutters, scrolling navigation and media 16:9 versus wide 3:2 banner columns and 4:3 media. Current/ancestor links are bold underlined; an outdated leading-marker comment must not override executable SCSS.",
      "coverage": "HubHeader/chrome/IconCard open. Existing Hero is partial, not a substitute for HubHeader. Routing/overflow observers remain browser runtime, with static selected route states represented separately."
    },
